### AcxiomCRM API requests (Visual Studio .http file / VS Code REST Client)
@base = http://localhost:5173

### 1. Sign in - copy accessToken from the response into @token below
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "rohan.das@acxiomcrm.local", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Customers in my scope
GET {{base}}/api/customers?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Ankit Senapati", "email": "ankit.senapati@example.com", "phone": "9437998877", "companyName": "Senapati Traders", "city": "Bhubaneswar", "state": "Odisha", "status": "Active" }

### Invalid opportunity (amount 0, probability 120) -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/opportunities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "opportunityName": "Bad deal", "customerId": 1, "amount": 0, "stage": "Qualification", "probability": 120, "expectedCloseDate": "2020-01-01" }

### Pipeline report
GET {{base}}/api/reports/pipeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign out (revokes the token)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
